{:edb/db-before-t 1745 :edb/db-after-t 1746 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535058 50 #inst "2026-10-08T15:48:45.406Z" 13194139535058 true] [17592186059598 1020 #edb/ref 17592186328908 13194139535058 true] [17592186060160 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535058 true] [17592186060160 1100 "Find the exact value of $4\\operatorname{sin}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}).$" 13194139535058 true] [17592186060160 1100 "Find the exact value of $4\\sin (7.5^{∘})\\cos (7.5^{∘})\\cos (15^{∘})$." 13194139535058 false] [17592186060160 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={7.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({7.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot {7.5}^{∘})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({7.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\operatorname{sin}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =2\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the double-angle formula once more with $x={15}^{∘},$ we can further simplify the above expression: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{15}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{15}^{∘}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot {15}^{∘})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡({30}^{∘})\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\operatorname{sin}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({7.5}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({30}^{∘})=\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328908 1017 #edb/ref 17592186328909 13194139535058 true] [17592186328908 1089 "q-327771" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328908 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535058 true] [17592186328908 1100 "Find the exact value of $4\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{15}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{15}^{∘}.$\n\n$4\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{15}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{15}^{∘}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328908 1113 #uuid "92adad31-0676-5e5c-b234-81f262965d25" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328908 1145 "Let's recall the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={15}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot {15}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328909 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328910 13194139535058 true] [17592186328909 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535058 true] [17592186328909 1041 "field-1" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328909 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328910 13194139535058 true] [17592186328909 1110 #uuid "36e1c06e-02b3-5eb3-bb38-89c94e3dba9f" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328910 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535058 true] [17592186328910 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535058 true] [17592186328910 1111 #uuid "05d612ff-c79f-57e5-8848-f245950c16b1" 13194139535058 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-327771" 17592186328908 "q-327771/field-1" 17592186328909 "q-327771/field-1/73eeaf3fae024b54005d89a5185040ad67cf4b6c72d401d6ad32bf0e79c13de9" 17592186328910} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
